Z||000032||artherd||11-26-2001||03:43 AM||||I really like the last-gen 300zx cars, *especially* the convertibles!!!<P>Quick, beautiful, fun, comfortable, and reliable.  Great all around automobile!<P>And the TT cars (300/320bhp stock) were no slouches and can be modified easially!!<P>The 222bhp NA cars were still great with a stick.<P>But can you drop a 32-valve 4-cam V8 Northstar V8 in there?  BZZZt! you loose!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>Still wouldn't mind owning a 300zx one day.  Definately have to get a convertible  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
