Z||000038||CoolBlue87GT||11-26-2001||09:19 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by stimpy:<BR><B>You peolpe are a bunch of sycophants! ?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Oh Stimpy,<P>Tisk tisk, to much caffeine ??  Why are you so hostile ?<P>The gentleman might have a job, which would put him out of touch with the forum <BR>durning working hours.<P>I defend him for a number of reasons,<P>1. He's done nothing wrong, hasn't burn anyone with nasty comments.<P>2. Hasn't tried to pick on anyone.<P>3. Just is inquiring about why we like our cars so much.<P>WHAT IS WRONG WITH THAT ??<P>I would be curious if I found a Forum on the net that was setup for umm, say AMC owners.<P>I'd post a friendly set of questions there. Would take the time & read what the were talking<BR>about.<P>There's no foul in doing so.  -- In fact, now that I remember, I did find a site a few <BR>weeks <BR>ago for of all things, the Tucker.<P>I posted a few questions in their forum, and traded a few stories with a few of their members.<P>I treated them with respect, and they did the same.<P>No one invited me to kiss their "pimply white a$$" , as I think you put it.<P>Now, My main point here that I want you and all the members of our forum to know, and <BR><B>UNDERSTAND </B>,<P>I do not want our forum to be know as a place on line were we flame anyone that come<BR> along that doesn't own a Fiero.<P>That's just plan nasty, any has no place in this forum.<P>Want to argue about it ? -- If your answer yes, if that's your first reaction, Well  then<BR>that's my point.<P>You are just being to hostile.<P>F.Y.I. to all, I'll be 'off line' until 7:30 PM as I'll be work till then.<P>I hope I've opened up a topic that helps all to see another view. My intent is not to argue,<BR>it's to get along with everyone.<P>I'll log in tonight to see what damages I've done.<p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 11-26-2001).]||||reg||4
