Z||000043||88CoupeV6||11-26-2001||10:54 AM||||I just love the look and sound of a Fiero. They were designed around the drivers seat. So everything is comfortable. There is a lot of foot room. You feel like your one with the car. I also like how they are safe and solid. It has a space frame so it is almost as good as volvo in a crash <BR>test. The outside will never rust.<P>Here are a few pics of mine<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/im7.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Lucky7.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Lucky6.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Lucky3.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Lucky4.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88coupeV6.jpg">       <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>    <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/nefa.htm" TARGET=_blank>Join New England Fiero Association</A>||||reg||7
