Z||000048||Monkeyman||11-26-2001||05:15 PM||||When we talk trash about "Jap crap" and "imports", we become as low as those import owners that talk trash about Fieros.  Personally, I don't have anything against Japanese automobiles (or German, Italian, etc).  The Japanese make some of the most reliable cars in the world and up until recently, some of the most inexpensive.  I'm not saying that all Japanese cars are better than the Fiero or vice versa, but we shouldn't stoop to some of the import owners levels.  (How many of us have both a Fiero and an import in our driveways?  I know of a half dozen without even thinking.)<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/patriot.gif">    <BR><B><FONT COLOR="red">Proud</FONT> <FONT COLOR="white">to be an</FONT> <FONT COLOR="blue">American</FONT>!!</B>||||reg||1
