Z||000050||MinnGreenGT||11-26-2001||05:38 PM||||Matt- I'm glad to see you respond again to your thread... I'd also like to point out that not everyone here shares the harsh opinions toward "outsiders".  My best friend drives a 1st Gen 300zx and it's a blast- and will probably last forever.  I have nothing against imports, especially 300zx TT's   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> seeing as how I've never even driven a newer one!  I hope that you run through some of the above galleries and search through some topics to read and understand why we appreciate the uniqueness of the Fiero.  Welcome- and stick around to see what you think!<P>[edit] BTW: I noticed that you're located right in the center of IL.  You should consider cruising up to the Chicago area for the Fierorama event in early September, or even the National Fiero Convention (in Missouri this year) the first weekend of August.  If you're really interested that is... [/edit]<P>------------------<BR>               <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 11-26-2001).]||||reg||1
