Z||000055||Cheever3000||11-26-2001||11:12 PM||||Apparently there are lots of car forums where the peeps do nothing but flame-or-be-flamed, and someone who sees nothing else then stumbles here might start by showing how loud he can bark.  <P>You seem to recognize that this place has a high percentage of people who try very hard to make it a good place to be, so you must have some sense of decency & civility.  I've already seen your later posts which indicate you may be a fun guy yourself.  I just hope you'll hang around long enough to learn something, then spread the word, and help to take the myth out of the public's perceptions.  There are a LOT of members here who simply would not have anything other than Fieros!  There are reasons for that.<BR>||||reg||1
